sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 👤 Client
    participant Channel as 📧 Email / SFTP
    participant AIP as 🔄 AMG Integration Platform
    participant Engine as 🧠 AI Engine
    participant Analyzer as 📄 Doc Analyzer
    participant Generator as 💡 Answer Generator
    participant KB as 📚 Knowledge Base
    participant LLM as ☁️ LLM API
    participant Writer as ✍️ Doc Writer
    participant Policy as 📋 Approval Policy
    participant Reviewer as 👤 Reviewer
    participant FeedbackDB as 📊 Feedback Store

    %% ───── Stage 1: Document Arrival ─────
    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Client,Channel: 1. Document Arrival
        Client->>Channel: Send questionnaire (Word / Excel)
        Channel->>AIP: File received via adapter
    end

    %% ───── Stage 2: AIP Ingestion ─────
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over AIP,AIP: 2. AIP Ingestion & Routing
        AIP->>AIP: Validate file & extract metadata
        AIP->>AIP: Classify → questionnaire detected
    end

    %% ───── Stage 3: Job Submission ─────
    rect rgb(232, 234, 246)
        Note over AIP,Engine: 3. Job Submission
        AIP->>Engine: POST /api/engine/process
        Engine-->>AIP: 202 Accepted (jobId)
    end

    %% ───── Stage 4: Multi-Agent AI Processing ─────
    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note over Engine,Writer: 4. Multi-Agent AI Processing
        Engine->>Analyzer: Analyze document structure
        Analyzer->>LLM: Identify questions (batch)
        LLM-->>Analyzer: Classified results
        Analyzer-->>Engine: Questions extracted

        Engine->>Generator: Generate answers
        loop Each question
            Generator->>KB: Vector similarity search
            KB-->>Generator: Relevant passages + sources
            Generator->>LLM: Generate answer + context
            LLM-->>Generator: Traceable answer + confidence
        end
        Generator-->>Engine: All answers + confidence scores

        Engine->>Writer: Write answers to document
        Writer-->>Engine: Completed document + source report
    end

    %% ───── Stage 5: Confidence-Based Review Routing ─────
    rect rgb(255, 253, 231)
        Note over Engine,Reviewer: 5. Approval Routing (Confidence-Based)
        Engine->>AIP: Callback (completed file + confidence scores)
        AIP->>Policy: Evaluate each answer's confidence

        alt All answers ≥ 85% & non-sensitive
            Policy-->>AIP: AUTO-APPROVE
            AIP->>AIP: Mark as AI-generated (auditable)
        else Any answer 60%–85%
            Policy-->>AIP: SINGLE REVIEW
            AIP->>Reviewer: Assign to primary reviewer
        else Any answer < 60% or sensitive topic
            Policy-->>AIP: ESCALATION
            AIP->>Reviewer: Assign to senior reviewer + domain expert
        end
    end

    %% ───── Stage 6: Human Review & Feedback ─────
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Reviewer,FeedbackDB: 6. Human Review & Feedback Collection
        Reviewer->>Reviewer: Review each flagged answer (with sources)

        alt Accept answer
            Reviewer->>AIP: Accept (no changes)
            AIP->>FeedbackDB: Log: ACCEPTED {questionId, confidence}
        else Edit answer
            Reviewer->>AIP: Submit corrected answer + reason
            AIP->>FeedbackDB: Log: EDITED {questionId, original, corrected, reason}
        else Reject answer
            Reviewer->>AIP: Reject with reason
            AIP->>FeedbackDB: Log: REJECTED {questionId, reason}
            AIP->>Engine: Re-generate with additional context
            Engine-->>AIP: Revised answer
            AIP->>Reviewer: Re-route for review
        end
    end

    %% ───── Stage 7: Finalize & Deliver ─────
    rect rgb(200, 230, 201)
        Note over AIP,Client: 7. Finalize & Deliver
        AIP->>AIP: Merge approved answers into final document
        AIP->>AIP: Attach audit trail + source report
        AIP->>Channel: Deliver via configured channel
        Channel->>Client: Filled document + traceability report
    end

    %% ───── Stage 8: Continuous Improvement & KB Auto-Update ─────
    rect rgb(232, 234, 246)
        Note over FeedbackDB,LLM: 8. Continuous Improvement & KB Auto-Update
        FeedbackDB->>FeedbackDB: Aggregate feedback metrics

        alt Repeated corrections detected (knowledge gap)
            FeedbackDB->>KB: Flag knowledge gap → admin review
        end
        alt High-quality corrections available
            FeedbackDB->>KB: Propose new KB entries from edits
        end
        alt Scheduled scan / new files detected
            AIP->>KB: Auto-ingest new documents from watched folders
        end

        KB->>KB: Validate, chunk & diff against existing
        KB->>LLM: Generate / refresh embeddings
        KB->>KB: Update vector store + metadata registry
        Note over KB: Verify search quality → audit log
    end
